OL,3,GNEWSAMonk on Caldey Island gave naked
OL,4,Aphotos of himself to visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has spoken out for the first
OL,7,Ftime about an alleged sexual assault by
OL,8,Fa monk who lived on a private island
OL,9,Foff the coast of west Wales.
OL,11,FBrother Titus Keet, 78, has also been
OL,12,Faccused of sexually harassing and
OL,13,Fsexually assaulting a former Caldey
OL,14,FIsland employee as well as giving women
OL,15,Fnaked photos of himself.
OL,17,FHe denied the allegations saying "a
OL,18,Fwoman who feels rejected can become
OL,19,Fvery vicious" and said the pictures
OL,20,Fwere not sexual, but he would reflect
OL,21,Fon his behaviour.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
