OL,3,GNEWSAMonk on Caldey Island gave naked
OL,4,Aphotos of himself to visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe claims, revealed in a new BBC
OL,7,Fpodcast Dark Island, were investigated
OL,8,Fby Dyfed-Powys Police but there was no
OL,9,Ffurther action.
